From the above metrics, we can observe that although both MFF and LTA unicards have similar UI, the LTA unicard outperforms MFF in all the key metrics.
Metric Impact
Here's how improving each key metric creates value:
Impression Rate: More impressions accelerate the model's learning process. This allows the model to converge on its true performance more quickly.
Click-Through Rate (CTR): A higher CTR indicates greater relevance for users and directly increases revenue for Google.
Conversion Rate (CvR): This is the most critical metric for advertisers, as it reflects the return on their ad spend and the format's ability to drive business results.
Click Split (Long / Short Clicks): A higher ratio of long clicks proves we are delivering a valuable post-click experience for users.
Cost Per Click (CPC): This metric balances Google's revenue with advertiser value. It must be managed carefully to prevent churn.
