Ideas to Improve Impression Rate
[L] Introduce a High Skip-Value Trumpable Format: Co-trigger a trumpable format with a high skip value alongside the base MFF format. This would artificially boost the pCTR incentivizing serving models to select the format more frequently.
[L] Expand Eligibility Criteria: Broaden MFF eligibility beyond the 'message' goal to also include campaigns with 'Call only', 'LFA only' or 'Call + LFA' goals.
[M] Support Pinned Headlines: Remove the current restriction that marks MFF as ineligible for ads with pinned headlines, or update the Ad UI to display the pinned headline within the format.
Background: 62.5% of potential MFF creatives are currently disqualified because they have a pinned headline. 
Q1. Can we show MFF even for campaigns with pinned headlines?
Q2. Can we update the MFF UI to accommodate pinned headlines?
[M] Identify Fallback Images: Enable MFF for campaigns that lack AIE or GMB images by identifying possible fallback images, such as a map tile or business logo.
Background: 40.6% of potential MFF campaigns are currently disqualified because they don’t have AIE or GMB images.
Q1. Can we identify a fallback for campaigns that don’t have AIE or GMB? 
Business logo, Map tile
[L] Implement MIA Multiplier: Implement an MIA multiplier to increase the effective bid for MFF in the ad auction.
