[L] Splitting MFF into Trumpable Sub-formats: [proposal doc] By splitting MFF into components, the serving model can learn which individual elements are most effective, allowing the auction to optimize for higher-CTR combinations.
[L] Enable Co-triggering with Other Assets: Allow MFF to be served with other existing formats or assets creating additional click targets on the ad.
Background: We've observed that for over 88% of MFF-eligible impressions, other assets—such as Sitelinks, Favicon, Callouts, and Structured Snippets—are also available.
