[S] Enforce Business Name Requirement: Make the business name asset a requirement for MFF eligibility, as experiments show ads with business names have a higher CTR than those with a root domain fallback.
[M] Experiment with Longer Headlines: Test longer headlines, including a two-line variation. Experiments have shown a correlation between headline length and CTR.
Background: For MFF ads in the first top-slot position, headlines with 20 or more characters achieve a 2.6% higher CTR than headlines with fewer than 5 characters.
