[XL] Update Format UX: Redesign the user experience to make the format more visually appealing and engaging.
[M] Provide Advertiser Recommendations: Suggest advertisers to add a business name asset to improve performance.
[XL] Improve Image Quality: Filter out low-quality AIE images and explore fetching higher-quality images from other available sources.
