Ideas to Improve Click Split (Long/Short Clicks)
[L] Add Longer-Engagement Actions: Add actions to the post-click page that require longer user engagement, such as Call, LFA, or Website links.
[M] Implement an Image Viewer: Allow users to click on an image to open a viewer, increasing time spent on the post-click page.
[XL] Provide Richer Advertiser Information in PCP: Add new, detailed advertiser information to the post-click page—beyond what is shown on the SRP—to hold user attention and provide more value to the user.
Q1. What other data can we display on the post click page?
Main section from the website in the about section
Images from advertiser website
Products / service details from website / GMB
[L] Good Click Modeling for MFF: Update the "good click" thresholds for MFF clicks. The current thresholds are trained for website visits, but the duration of a good user interaction could be very different for message clicks.
[XL] Redesign Post-Click UX: Redesign the post-click experience to be more engaging and interactive.
Ideas to Improve Cost Per Click (CPC)
[M] Identify Optimal Bidding Strategies: Analyze performance data to identify and recommend the most effective bidding strategies for this format.
[XL] Boost MFF LTV: Boost LTV for MFF in auction on queries with very high message intent. This will allow MFF to win on high message intent queries with lower bid.
[L] Enable MIA for MFF: With MIA we can control the bids for MFF clicks.


